1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,164
Good morning.

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:05,280
This is Burnham tourist office, Martin speaking.

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:05,987
Oh, hello.

4
00:00:05,987 --> 00:00:10,229
I saw a poster about free things to do in the area,

5
00:00:10,229 --> 00:00:13,410
and it said people should phone you for information.

6
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:18,792
I'm coming to Burnham with my husband and two children for a few days

7
00:00:18,792 --> 00:00:20,329
on June the 27th,

8
00:00:20,329 --> 00:00:21,867
or possibly the 28th,

9
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:26,480
and I'd like some ideas for things to do on the 29th.

10
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,520
Yes, of course.

11
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:27,867
OK.

12
00:00:27,867 --> 00:00:31,680
Then let's start with a couple of events especially for children.

13
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:35,504
The art gallery is holding an event called 'Family Welcome' that day,

14
00:00:35,504 --> 00:00:39,010
when there are activities and trails to use throughout the gallery.

15
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,304
That sounds interesting.

16
00:00:40,304 --> 00:00:42,460
What time does it start?

17
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,854
The gallery opens at 10,

18
00:00:43,854 --> 00:00:47,480
and the 'Family Welcome1 event runs from 10.30 until 2 o' clock.

19
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,405
The gallery stays open until 5.

20
00:00:49,405 --> 00:00:53,897
And several times during the day, they're going to show a short film that

21
00:00:53,897 --> 00:00:55,180
the gallery has produced.

22
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,182
It demonstrates how ceramics are made,

23
00:00:57,182 --> 00:01:01,520
and there'll be equipment and materials for children to have a go themselves.

24
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,833
Last time they ran the event, there was a film about painting,

25
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:07,041
which went down very well with the children,

26
00:01:07,041 --> 00:01:09,250
and they're now working on one about sculpture.

27
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:11,724
I like the sound of that.

28
00:01:11,724 --> 00:01:14,610
And what other events happen in Burnham?

29
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:16,730
Well, do you all enjoy listening to music?

30
00:01:16,730 --> 00:01:17,820
Oh, yes.

31
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:21,589
Well there are several free concerts taking place at different times - one

32
00:01:21,589 --> 00:01:24,416
or two in the morning, the majority at lunchtime,

33
00:01:24,416 --> 00:01:26,300
and a couple in the evening.

34
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:29,110
And they range from pop music to Latin American.

35
00:01:29,110 --> 00:01:31,318
The Latin American could be fun.

36
00:01:31,318 --> 00:01:32,790
What time is that?

37
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:35,740
It's being repeated several times,in different places.

38
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:39,944
They're performing in the central library at 1 o'clock, then at 4 it' s

39
00:01:39,944 --> 00:01:41,146
in the City Museum,

40
00:01:41,146 --> 00:01:45,350
and in the evening, at 7.30, there's a longer concert, in the theatre.

41
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:45,695
Right.

42
00:01:45,695 --> 00:01:48,800
I'll suggest that to the rest of the family.

43
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:52,300
Something else you might be interested in is the boat race along the river.

44
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:54,830
Oh, yes, do tell me about that.

45
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:58,136
The race starts at Offord Marina, to the north of Burnham,

46
00:01:58,136 --> 00:02:00,240
and goes as far as Summer Pool.

47
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:04,405
The best place to watch it from is Charlesworth Bridge, though that does get

48
00:02:04,405 --> 00:02:05,000
rather crowded.

49
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,920
And who's taking part?

50
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,260
Well, local boat clubs,

51
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:10,270
but the standard is very high.

52
00:02:10,270 --> 00:02:14,226
One of them came first in the West of England regional championship in May

53
00:02:14,226 --> 00:02:17,900
this year - it was the first time a team from Burnham has won.

54
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:22,510
It means that next year they'll be representing the region in the national championship.

55
00:02:22,510 --> 00:02:30,054
Now I've heard something about Paxton Nature Reserve, It's a good place for spotting

56
00:02:30,054 --> 00:02:32,210
unusual birds, isn't it?

57
00:02:32,210 --> 00:02:33,708
That's right - throughout the year.

58
00:02:33,708 --> 00:02:36,703
There is a lake there, as well as a river,

59
00:02:36,703 --> 00:02:38,800
and they provide a very attractive habitat.

60
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,710
So it's a good idea to bring binoculars if you have them.

61
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:46,012
And just at the moment you can see various flowers that are pretty unusual

62
00:02:46,012 --> 00:02:48,163
- the soil at Paxton isn't very common.

63
00:02:48,163 --> 00:02:49,700
They're looking good right now.

64
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:50,187
Right.

65
00:02:50,187 --> 00:02:54,080
My husband will be particularly interested in that.

66
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:57,532
And there is going to be a talk and slide show about mushrooms -

67
00:02:57,532 --> 00:03:00,452
and you'll be able to go out and pick some afterwards

68
00:03:00,452 --> 00:03:01,780
and study the different varieties.

69
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:02,132
Uhuh.

70
00:03:02,132 --> 00:03:06,000
And is it possible for children to swim in the river?

71
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,217
Yes.

72
00:03:06,217 --> 00:03:09,256
Part of it has been fenced off to make it safe for children to

73
00:03:09,256 --> 00:03:09,690
swim in.

74
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:10,665
It's very shallow,

75
00:03:10,665 --> 00:03:13,590
and there's a lifeguard on duty whenever it's open.

76
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:15,145
The lake is too deep,

77
00:03:15,145 --> 00:03:16,700
so swimming isn't allowed there.

78
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:21,404
OK, we must remember to bring their swimming things, in case we go to

79
00:03:21,404 --> 00:03:21,740
Paxton.

80
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:25,450
How long does it take to get there by car from Burnham?

81
00:03:25,450 --> 00:03:26,430
About 20 minutes,

82
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:28,063
but parking is very limited,

83
00:03:28,063 --> 00:03:31,003
so it's usually much easier to go by bus -

84
00:03:31,003 --> 00:03:33,290
and it takes about the same time.

85
00:03:33,290 --> 00:03:33,651
Right.

86
00:03:33,651 --> 00:03:37,623
Well, I'll discuss the options with the rest of the family.

87
00:03:37,623 --> 00:03:40,150
Thanks very much for all your help.

88
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:40,760
You're welcome.

89
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:41,670
Goodbye.

90
00:03:41,670 --> 00:03:42,780
Bye.
